{"version":1,"content":"<p>主張運用當地食材減少碳排放，已成近年Fine Dining趨勢。</p><p>台北一間米芝蓮綠星餐廳，9成食材來自台灣，炮製擺脫西餐框架的特色料理。</p><p>同市另一間高端食府，幾乎全部選用在地食材，烹調出別樹一幟的時尚歐陸菜。</p><p>香港亦有星級餐廳，將本地時令食材融入</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:20:58.080112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:11.314122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:11.314122+00:00","content_hash":"33627192ef487c0f232c1a90df542bbed21377742fbb7e594de12c3ee7e4bb88","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}